/**
 * @mainpage MIDILAR
 *
 * MIDILAR is the MIDI layer of the RoModular ecosystem: protocol, messages,
 * parsing, routing and real-time devices for desktop and embedded targets,
 * built on Foundation (general utilities) and MCC (music theory).
 *
 * @note MIDILAR is being rebuilt from scratch on the `rebuild` branch. Version
 * 0.1.0 is the scaffold; features arrive in the phases of `ACTION_PLAN.md`.
 *
 * @section MIDILARMainModules Modules
 *
 * - @ref MIDILAR_Core "Core": MIDILAR, MCC and Foundation version information.
 *
 * The rules MIDILAR types will follow are collected in the
 * @ref MIDILAR_Specification "MIDI-Domain Specification".
 *
 * @section MIDILARMainDependency Dependencies
 *
 * MIDILAR links `Foundation::Foundation` (Foundation 1.4 or a newer 1.x
 * release) and `MCC::MCC` (MCC 0.5.1 or a newer 0.x release). It uses local
 * packages when available and otherwise fetches the pinned releases from
 * GitHub; see @ref MIDILAR_BuildGuide_Dependency.
 */
